# Changing the Warlord's Wall to Human makes it count non-Human creatures, including Ornithopter (CR 612.1).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Keldon Warlord
Ornithopter
Artificial Evolution
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
